WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.880
We love opening and reading all of your mail.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.830
And I can't wait to get to your letters,

3
00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.290
but first let's celebrate our zip code of the day.

4
00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:13.200
It's 55427 Minneapolis, Minnesota,

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.980
home of our affiliate station KARE 11,

6
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.140
and home of the Minneapolis Skyway,

7
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.560
the longest continuous skyway system in the world,

8
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.560
spanning 69 downtown blocks!

9
00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.360
In 2012, Minneapolis celebrated

10
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.870
the first internet cat video festival

11
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:36.870
at the Walker Art Center with more than 10,000 attendees.

12
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.410
Minneapolis, Minnesota, we would love to hear from you.

13
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.560
And please, we want you to know from our show

14
00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.310
that we acknowledge you're the epicenter

15
00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.490
of news and demand for change in our country.

16
00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.623
So we would love to have any exchange with you possible.

17
00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:55.223
(audience applauding)
Now to our first letter.

18
00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.083
Okie dokie.

19
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.687
Okay.

20
00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:05.430
"Dear Drew, after being an art teacher for 35 years,

21
00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:08.640
I found a second career as the activity director

22
00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.600
at Dowling Gardens in Sparkill, New York.

23
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.750
Our mission is to provide a safe, affordable,

24
00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.870
caring housing community for seniors,

25
00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.570
and due to the current pandemic,

26
00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.930
all of our activities have to be outside.

27
00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.010
I wonder if Jonah would like to donate

28
00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.980
one of his crocheted coverlets to one of our residents

29
00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:29.600
as a bingo prize!" from Beth in Sparkill, New York.

30
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.930
All right, it turns out that our producers spoke with Jonah,

31
00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:37.000
and he was so happy to help that he is donating 10

32
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.600
of his beautiful creations!
(audience applauding)

33
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.070
Look at this big beautiful basket that Jonah did!

34
00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.280
Oh, this is so gorgeous.

35
00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.980
Look at these.

36
00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:51.190
Oh, Beth, I hope this is what you were thinking.

37
00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:52.690
Woo!
Thank you, Jonah.

38
00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:56.002
Thank you so much.
(audience applauding)

39
00:01:56.002 --> 00:01:59.940
Oh Jonah, you're just the best.

40
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:04.940
Okay, ow, ow, ow, turns out don't cross your legs

41
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.140
and then roll on in.

42
00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.337
Okay, next letter, all righty.

43
00:02:10.337 --> 00:02:13.610
"Hi Drew, I'm a stationary note card jewelry designer,

44
00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.430
and it's wonderful to see the art of letter writing

45
00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:17.710
making a comeback.

46
00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.503
Here's your very own personalized stationary.

47
00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.200
If you love it, I'd be thrilled

48
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.010
if you could give a shout out to our little boutique,

49
00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:28.440
RooBarb Studios in Ohio.

50
00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.310
Like all small businesses today,

51
00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.980
we could use a little boost."

52
00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.403
Jody, Findlay, Ohio.

53
00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.660
Is there stationary?

54
00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.270
Oh, there is!

55
00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.453
Oh my goodness.

56
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:44.449
Aw! I love it!

57
00:02:44.449 --> 00:02:46.300
(audience laughs)
Oh gosh.

58
00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.280
Oh, this is gorgeous.

59
00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.610
Thank you, Jody.

60
00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.804
This is amazing.

61
00:02:52.804 --> 00:02:57.207
(audience applauding)
Stationary with my name on it!

62
00:02:58.487 --> 00:03:03.212
Thank you! Thank you, Jody.
(audience applauding)

63
00:03:03.212 --> 00:03:05.250
I have to tell you, you sent this to the right place

64
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.630
because I love being a supporter of small businesses,

65
00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.270
and I'll do better than a shout out.

66
00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.642
We're gonna feature you in our Little Yellow Book

67
00:03:12.642 --> 00:03:15.010
(audience applauding)
as well

68
00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.200
as in our small business gift guide,

69
00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.130
so thank you very much for your most personal gift

70
00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.040
of personalized stationary.

71
00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.510
Jody, from one lover of letters to another.

72
00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.930
Okay, our last letter comes from Lance

73
00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.120
in Jackson, California,

74
00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.350
and he had actually written to us before,

75
00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.540
asking about like a metal detector

76
00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.680
because he wanted to go trace Howard Hughes

77
00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:40.820
and have some adventures.

78
00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.710
I don't know, let's find out what he's writing about now.

79
00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.830
Okay, "Dear Drew,

80
00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.060
I'm glad I wrote you, but I wished I asked

81
00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.680
for world peace or something,

82
00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.910
and I'm withdrawing my request for a metal detector."

83
00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.743
Huh.

84
00:03:53.743 --> 00:03:57.240
"I still plan on exploring Howard Hughes's old haunts,

85
00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:00.800
and don't be surprised to see a package in the mail,

86
00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.040
old school with halvsies like I promised.

87
00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.850
I have four daughters, and my favorite nonprofit

88
00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.550
is Tracey's Place of Hope where they provide a safe place

89
00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:14.580
for girls in bad situations and nowhere else to go.

90
00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:17.950
You do so many wonderful things for this world.

91
00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:21.830
Please donate that money to them instead."

92
00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.920
Lance in Jackson, California.

93
00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.000
Oh, I think Lance we've just figured out

94
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.360
that you're the good person here,

95
00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.640
and you're the inspiring one.

96
00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:36.028
So we're gonna donate $1,000 that we were gonna send to you.

97
00:04:36.028 --> 00:04:37.620
(audience applauding)

98
00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:42.243
But I will double it, so we'll send $2,000 to that charity

99
00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:47.720
with your name on it Lance, because this is all about you.

100
00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.680
So anyone else out there, if you see anything,

101
00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.890
want anything, advice, help,

102
00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.580
maybe you want to share something, send me a joke.

103
00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.540
A photo, requests, heartfelt funny stories,

104
00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:03.820
whatever it is, please go to our address

105
00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.750 line:15%
at TheDrewBarrymoreShow.com/DearDrew.

106
00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.760 line:15%
I would love to get your letters.

107
00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.410 line:15%
Thank you so much, and on behalf of the show,

108
00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.740 line:15%
Beth, Jody, and Lance, thank you so much for your letters.

109
00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.680 line:15%
And here are my postcards to you.

110
00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:21.406 line:15%
All right, truly yours, Drew.

111
00:05:21.406 --> 00:05:23.989 line:15%
(upbeat music)

